#: Module.php
msgid "A research project is both an item and the item set of its collection. When on, the item set’s page answers with a permanent redirect (301) to the project item, which is then the project’s one page in search engines and the sitemap. An item set is a project’s when its “Is Part Of” links to the public project item, or the public project item has the same dre:id."
msgstr ""

