#: src/Form/ConfigForm.php
msgid "Notifies Bing/Yandex (and other IndexNow engines) when a public item, item set or page is added, edited, made private or deleted, so the change is crawled sooner. Changed URLs wait in a queue that the server’s five-minute cron (scripts/drain-indexnow.php) sends in batches of 200; a save also starts a batch at most every 15 minutes. Google is not pinged (its ping endpoint was retired — Google uses robots.txt + Search Console instead)."
